{
  "_about": "路由日志 `>>>` 行与 `/v1/messages` 响应头的**探针证据**，同时作为 `internal/bodytransform` 的测试数据源（behavior.md §3.0 与 §一的判据来源）。",
  "_captured": "2026-10-04",
  "_method": "tools/behavior_diff.py 的假上游 + Python 靶机；一次性探针脚本 D:/tmp/probe_marks{,2,3,4}.py（定向实验，不进仓库）。",
  "_why": "`>>>` 第 4 字段此前被记成「首条用户文本」，但全量采样的 m-multiturn 场景（messages = [user hi, assistant yo, user again]）印出的是 `again` —— 与首条不符。本文件用构造把「首条 / 末条 / 末条 user / 首个可提取文本」四者分开。",
  "_schema": "field_probes[].request 是**逐字节**的入站体（测试直接喂给 bodytransform.Inspect）；expect 是 Go 侧应有的取值；observed_line 是 Python 靶机实际打出的那一行。`expect.error` 为 `not_object` / `model_not_string` 时表示应返回对应错误。",
  "route_log_line": ">>> <reqid>  <model>  sync|stream  \"<preview>\"",
  "field_probes": [
    {
      "id": "p-first-vs-last",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"FIRST\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"MID\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"LASTUSER\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"LASTASSIST\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "LASTUSER"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"LASTUSER\"",
      "note": "preview 取**最后一条 role==\"user\"** 的消息；末尾的 assistant 消息不参与。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-single-assistant",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"ONLY-ASSIST\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "没有 role==\"user\" 的消息 ⇒ 空串。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-array-first-text-block",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"BLOCK-A\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"BLOCK-B\"}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"LAST-BLOCK-A\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"LAST-BLOCK-B\"}]}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "LAST-BLOCK-A"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"LAST-BLOCK-A\"",
      "note": "content 是数组时取**该条**里第一个 `type==\"text\"` 块的 text（不是拼接、也不是最后一块）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-array-skips-nontext-block",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"tool_result\", \"content\": \"zzz\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"SECOND-TEXT\"}]}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "SECOND-TEXT"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"SECOND-TEXT\"",
      "note": "数组里非 text 的块被跳过，继续找下一个 text 块。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-missing-content-falls-back",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"OLD\"}, {\"role\": \"user\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "OLD"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"OLD\"",
      "note": "末条 user 取不出文本时**不覆盖**已有值 ⇒ 回落到更早的 user 消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-empty-string-overwrites",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"A\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "content 是**空字符串**时**会**覆盖 ⇒ 判据是「content 是不是字符串」，不是「文本是否非空」。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-empty-array-does-not-overwrite",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": []}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"B\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "B"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"B\"",
      "note": "空数组里找不到 text 块 ⇒ 不覆盖。（与上一条的差别：字符串形态总能取到值，数组形态要找到 text 块才取值。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-textblock-without-text-key",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"C\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\"}]}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "找到了 text 块但块里没有 text 键 ⇒ 取成空串并**覆盖**。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-text-empty-string",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"E\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"\"}]}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "text 是空串 ⇒ 覆盖成空串。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-text-nonstring",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"D\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": 123}]}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": "（无该行）—— 参考实现直接 500 `text/plain` `Internal Server Error`，零出站",
      "note": "text 块的值不是字符串 ⇒ 参考实现**未处理异常**。本实现**有意偏离**：取空串、不崩（behavior.md §六）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-role-case-sensitive",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"OLD\"}, {\"role\": \"USER\", \"content\": \"CAPS\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": "OLD"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"OLD\"",
      "note": "role 比较是**大小写敏感**的（\"USER\" 不算 user）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-no-role-field",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"content\": \"NO-ROLE\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "缺 role 键 ⇒ 不参与。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-messages-not-array",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"OBJ\"}}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "messages 不是数组 ⇒ 空串（且**不影响转发**：出站照常 1 次）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-messages-item-not-object",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [\"plain\"]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "元素不是对象 ⇒ 跳过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-no-messages",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "请求体没有 messages 键 ⇒ 空串。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-content-null",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"GLM-5.3\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": null}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "GLM-5.3", "stream": false, "preview": ""},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  GLM-5.3  sync  \"\"",
      "note": "content 为 null ⇒ 取不出、不覆盖（此处只有一条，故空串）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-model-missing",
      "request": "{\"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"hi\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "", "model_label": "-", "stream": false, "preview": "hi"},
