      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  -  sync  \"hi\"",
      "note": "空串 ⇒ 印 `-` ⇒ 判据是**真值**（`model or \"-\"`）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-model-unknown-passthrough",
      "request": "{\"model\": \"no-such-model-xyz\", \"max_tokens\": 16, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"hi\"}]}",
      "expect": {"model": "no-such-model-xyz", "stream": false, "preview": "hi"},
      "observed_line": ">>> <reqid>  no-such-model-xyz  sync  \"hi\"",
      "note": "**不做模型名校验**，原样回显（且照常出站）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-model-number",
